gZR(){return"Dates and destination"},
gZQ(){return"# Where to go\nNothing has to be decided yet \u2014 jot down anywhere that catches your eye.\n\n## Dates\n- Leaving\n- Coming back\n- Booking reference for the room\n\n## Places to visit\n- First stop of the day\n- Somewhere for a rainy afternoon\n- A shop to drop into on the way back\n\n> Fill it in as it firms up, and on the day this one page is all you need to look at."},
gZT(){return"Packing and budget"},
gZS(){return"# Packing\n- [ ] ID and tickets\n- [ ] Charger and power bank\n- [ ] Any medication\n- [ ] Change of clothes\n\n# Rough budget\n- Travel\n- Somewhere to stay\n- Food and souvenirs\n\nTickets saved as a photo or a PDF can be attached to this page."},
gZz(){return"Reading notes"},
gZB(){return"Books I've read"},
gZA(){return"# Title / Author\n\n## A line worth keeping\n> Copy a passage out here, and reading it back brings the whole feeling of the book with it.\n\n## Thoughts\n- What stayed with me\n- What I'd tell someone about it\n\nAdd a page each time you finish a book, and the whole shelf ends up in this one note."},
gZC(){return"Recipes"},
gZE(){return"Something to cook"},
gZD(){return"# Dish\n\n## Ingredients (serves 2)\nWrite them out with the amounts and you can read the list straight off while shopping.\n\n## Method\n1. Prep\n2. Cook\n3. Season to taste\n\n## Notes\nAttach a photo of how it turned out \u2014 it's the best reminder next time round."},
